 href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/38px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/50px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exxvikyap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/38px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/50px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fytz the Firecracker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\">Fytz the Firecracker</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Armoury\" title=\"