wers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Using this arrow costs an entire <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>, so it cannot be used as one of the 'attacks' from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Improved Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Improved Extra Attack\">Improved Extra Attack</a>.</li>\n<li>This arrow always hits its target unless some condition prevents that from happening, for example <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reflectoguard_Active_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflectoguard Active (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reflectoguard Active\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reflectoguard_Active_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflectoguard Active (Condition)\">Reflectoguard Active</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reflective_Shell_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflective Shell (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reflective Shell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reflective_Shell_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflective Shell (Condition)\">Reflective Shell</a>.</li>\n<li>Shooting this arrow ends <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisibility</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hiding</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Arrow of Salving has 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" titl